takeover.description:
HomeDarts for Autodarts is the new name of the integration Autodarts. These boards are still set up under the old name:

{boards}

Taking them over keeps everything: the settings, the entities with their IDs, history and statistics, the training, the games and the reports, the highlights, exports and voice packs, and the cards in your dashboards. Then the old integration and its files are removed. Automations and scripts that call its actions, such as `autodarts.start_game`, need the new name, `homedarts.start_game`: a repair lists them. Restart Home Assistant afterwards.

takeover_references.description:
HomeDarts for Autodarts took over your boards. These still use actions or cards of the integration under its old name, Autodarts, which no longer exist:

{items}

In their actions, replace `autodarts.` with `homedarts.`, for example `homedarts.start_game`, and in the types of the cards `custom:autodarts` with `custom:homedarts`. Then ignore this repair.
